{"item":{"key":"moment:1572652","id":"1572652","kind":"moment","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1631894400000,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈哈！！！画面感好强！//[at uid=2875]@喂兔乃吃一口葱油饼再吃一口哈密瓜[/at]：有一黑皮小孩前来买瓜。 老奶奶的老伴：[emot=acfun,1684/]哎，生异形吗老婆你这。 黑皮小孩阿望：[emot=acfun,1689/]奶奶，你这瓜多少钱一斤啊？ 老奶奶：[emot=acfun,1688/]两块钱一斤。 阿望：[emot=acfun,1705/]what's up，奶奶你这瓜皮是金子做的还是瓜子是金子做的。 老奶奶：[emot=acfun,1691/]这都是大棚的瓜，你嫌贵我还嫌贵呢。 阿望：[emot=acfun,1703/]给我挑一个。 老奶奶：[emot=acfun,1678/]行。（转头） 【于是阿望趁老奶奶不注意，在电光火石之际，一把抢过了蒲扇。】 老奶奶：[emot=acfun,1685/]哎你这瓜皮娃儿，找茬的是不是！ 迅速把蒲扇插在背后的阿望：[emot=acfun,1727/]萨日朗~萨日朗~（边唱边跳） 某位拼命用双手挤着胸前的不愿透露姓名的水某：[emot=acfun,1725/]阿望，哎阿望。 【最后水某把阿望带到老奶奶瓜摊并把蒲扇物归原主，皆大欢喜】","title":"","images":[],"cover":"","duration":"","views":0,"counts":{"commentCount":2,"likeCount":65,"bananaCount":46,"shareCount":0},"url":"https://m.acfun.cn/communityCircle/moment/1572652","timePrecision":"day","source":{"key":"article:31133703","id":"31133703","kind":"article","user":{"id":"179922","name":"1001Project","avatar":"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0"},"time":1631967531282,"text":"","title":"【四格】一定不止阿望这么干过","images":["3020e86ea79f6e40c16664de"],"cover":"","duration":"","views":32160,"counts":{"commentCount":119,"likeCount":3283,"bananaCount":16297,"shareCount":1},"url":"https://www.acfun.cn/a/ac31133703"},"commentsPending":false,"archivedComments":2,"archivedRoots":2,"threads":{},"commentPages":["comments/1572652/all/1.json"],"hotPages":[],"hotCount":0},"media":{"3020e86ea79f6e40c16664de":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/179922_68999367d8ff44d4aabbe37e2d561701.jpeg","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/179922_68999367d8ff44d4aabbe37e2d561701.jpeg?imageView2/2/w/0/q/75/ignore-error/1/format/webp|imageslim","https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/kimg/EIvK1y8qNwoFYWNmdW4SBWltYWdlGicxNzk5MjJfNjg5OTkzNjdkOGZmNDRkNGFhYmJlMzdlMmQ1NjE3MDE.jpg"]},"c782182a37eb4562669ac9f0":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/newUpload/179922_d1f3e455380346a0bdd3ebec5b12996f.png?imag